.89929％股权，转让底价约为2.19亿元，披露期为2026年10月26日至11月20日。标的资产已于2026年3月13日形成关于公司利润分配的股东决议，转让方获得分红金额为约5417.7032万元。本次资产转让底价已在评估价值基础上对前述分红金额进行扣除。","url":"https://wallstreetcn.com/live/3185122","source":"wallstreetcn","channel":"a-stock-channel","time":"2026-10-24T17:30:53+08:00","codes":[],"themes":[],"is_calendar":false},{"title":"莫高义任云南省委书记","summary":"日前，中共中央决定：莫高义同志任云南省委委员、常委、书记，王宁同志不再担任云南省委书记、常委、委员职务。（新华社）","url":"https://wallstreetcn.com/live/3185119","source":"wallstreetcn","channel":"a-stock-channel","time":"2026-10-24T16:57:37+08:00","codes":[],"themes":[],"is_calendar":false}]},"sources":["stocks-ai-view:data/hot_news.json","stocks-ai-view:data/news_digest.json","stocks-ai-view:data/news_impact.json","stocks-ai-view:data/news_transmission.json","stocks-ai-view:data/hot_themes.json","stocks-ai-view:data/news_extra.json","stocks-ai-view:data/hot_impact.json"]}